 : jusqu'à 595€ par mois en plus de ton salaire\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"6\",{\"property\":\"og:description\",\"content\":\"La prime d'activité est versée par la CAF aux travailleurs modestes. Beaucoup y ont droit sans le savoir. Conditions, montant et simulateur.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"7\",{\"property\":\"og:image\",\"content\":\"http://localhost:3000/images/articles/prime-activite-caf-2026-simulateur-conditions-montant.svg\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"8\",{\"property\":\"og:type\",\"content\":\"article\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"9\",{\"property\":\"article:published_time\",\"content\":\"2026-04-01\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"10\",{\"name\":\"twitter:card\",\"content\":\"summary_large_image\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"11\",{\"name\":\"twitter:title\",\"content\":\"Bons Plans Mania — Bons plans beauté & tests gratuits\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"12\",{\"name\":\"twitter:description\",\"content\":\"Les meilleurs bons plans beauté, tests gratuits, concours et avis box beauté.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"13\",{\"name\":\"twitter:image\",\"content\":\"http://localhost:3000/images/articles/prime-activite-caf-2026-simulateur-conditions-montant.svg\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"14\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.svg\",\"type\":\"image/svg+xml\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"15\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.ico\",\"sizes\":\"32x32\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"16\",{\"rel\":\"apple-touch-icon\",\"href\":\"/apple-touch-icon.png\"}],[\"$\",\"$L25\",\"17\",{}]]\n","segmentData":{"/_tree":":HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/e90239902b00a299.css\",\"style\"]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/media/829ba4228c966254-s.p.a61bc753.woff2\",\"font\",{\"crossOrigin\":\"\",\"type\":\"font/woff2\"}]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/media/a218039a3287bcfd-s.p.4a23d71b.woff2\",\"font\",{\"crossOrigin\":\"\",\"type\":\"font/woff2\"}]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/media/e2334d715941921e-s.p.d82a9aff.woff2\",\"font\",{\"crossOrigin\":\"\",\"type\":\"font/woff2\"}]\n0:{\"buildId\":\"ZhieIYc9JEX19SuhHMm2j\",\"tree\":{\"name\":\"\",\"paramType\":null,\"paramKey\":\"\",\"hasRuntimePre